=2 Walkthrough
\**{c=red:Notice:}** Wait one game day and re-zone after completing {q:Honor Under Fire|Honor Under Fire|Honor Under Fire} before starting this quest.
* Speak to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} in {z:Bastok Markets (S)} - (H-6) to begin the quest.
* Enter {z:Beadeaux (S)} for a cutscene.
** The {p:Survival Guide} in {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)} is right next to this entrance.
* Return to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)}.
* Speak to {n:Red Axe} in {z:The Eldieme Necropolis (S)} at (I-8).
** Using the {p:Campaign Arbiters} to arrive here puts you very close to {n:Red Axe}.
* Go to {n:Leadavox} in {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)} at (J-6) behind the Cyclopean Gates, and trade her a {i:Beeswax|Beeswax|913} and a {i:Red Textile Dye|Red Textile Dye|2712} to receive the {@k}{k:Wax seal}.
** Using the {p:Campaign Arbiters} places you due south of this objective, use your personal mount to ride north to reach this objective faster.
* Return to {n:Red Axe}.
* Speak to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)}.
* Go to {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} and examine the {p:Hoarfang} at (F-10) for a cutscene and your reward.
** The {p:Campaign Arbiters} to {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} puts you closest.
** If your inventory is full or you already have a {i:Super Reraiser|Super Reraiser|5770}, discard it and re-check the {p:Hoarfang} to obtain it without having to watch the entire cutscene again.

